== Section 1 __NOEDITSECTION__ ==
<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-section2">
<div class="mw-collapsible-content"> 

<blockquote>I'm pleased to be at Dawnfire. They make ships where I
work.</blockquote>

<blockquote>The others were hurt. I told them I don't want to be hurt.
I don't like fighting, I like making. I like making best.</blockquote>

<blockquote>I found some trees and I cut them and stuck them up. They
call it a prow.</blockquote>

<blockquote>I do it again, and again. War hurts, so I won't be
fighting in the war, but I will be making.</blockquote>

<blockquote>JJ (Written very crudely, which suggests all but the
signature is a dictation)</blockquote>

